{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7f735289-aef4-8774-9ca4-fd0dfb265d9e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T12:36:50-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Min-jun Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:33:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:33:17-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes. Um, I want to put a lost dog poster? I think I need to register it with the city. Is this the right office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:33:28-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, a lost dog. I'm sorry to hear that. Yes, I can take that down for you, and I'll pass it along to animal control. Let me get a few details. Can I have your name first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:33:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Min-jun Abdi. Min, M-I-N, then jun, J-U-N. Abdi, A-B-D-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:33:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Abdi. Let me read that back. Min-jun, M-I-N, J-U-N, Abdi, A-B-D-I. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:33:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:33:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And where did the dog go missing from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:34:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "From my house. It is 470 Ayrault Street. Historic Hill. The gate was open [pause] for a few minutes, and he went out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:34:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 470 Ayrault Street. Got it. Can you describe the dog for me? Size, color, anything like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "He is medium size? Maybe thirty pounds. The color is brown, light brown, with white on the chest and white on the front feet. Ears are not up, they go down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:34:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Light brown, white chest, white front paws, floppy ears, about thirty pounds. [pause] Does he have a collar or tag?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:34:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a blue collar. The tag has my phone number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:34:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that helps. And what number should animal control use to reach you? I'll just make sure I have it right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:34:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0197."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:34:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0197. Okay. [pause] Now, you said a poster. Did you want to put it up around the neighborhood?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I made a poster, with the photo. I want to put on poles and at the shop windows. Do I need permission? Or I register it here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:35:16-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Also, I must tell you, I go to Boston on Sunday? For a concert, with my friend. We stay two nights. So if someone finds him, my phone is okay, but I am not at home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:35:30-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that you're away Sunday and Monday, and that the phone number is the best way to reach you. As for the poster, I'll log it with the report so it's on record. For posting on poles, I'd say keep it small, use tape and not staples, and take it down once he's found. If you want to check about particular spots, I can have someone call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:35:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Tape, not staples. I understand. I will take down after."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Also, it's worth checking with the shelter and the local vets, in case someone brings him in. I'll send your report to animal control this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Should I send the poster to you? By email?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can bring a copy to the front counter here at City Hall if you like, and we'll attach it. Otherwise the description I've taken is enough to start."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can bring today. I will come after lunch? Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. We're here this afternoon. Just ask for the clerk's counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. You are very kind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Abdi. I hope he turns up soon. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T12:36:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
